  "title": {
   "en": "Chronicles of a Doomed Prodigy"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "How a Terminally Ill Genius Survives"
   },
   {
    "ko": "시한부 천재가 살아남는 법"
   },
   {
    "en": "Surviving as a Genius on Borrowed Time"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Gifted by the heavens yet cursed by fate, Yeonshin was born with unimaginable talent in martial arts. But this very gift condemned him to a life that would end before adulthood. With the right opportunities, he had the potential to become a legendary hero, or the reincarnation of the Heavenly Demon. Yet fate cast him into the third-rate Jeong Clan, a family of no particular renown. Now, with time slipping through his fingers, Yeonshin must find a way to defy his doomed destiny."
  },
